        "text": "Official English Q&A for BT16-051 (Nov. 1, 2024)"
      },
      {
        "link": "https://world.digimoncard.com/rule/?card_no=BT16-051#qaResult_card",
        "num": 2,
        "text": "Official English Q&A for BT16-051 (Jun. 6, 2024)"
      }
    ],
    "rulings": [
      {
        "answer": "It means that this Digimon can no longer leave the battle area by processing other than deletion. Such processing includes \"return to the hand/deck,\" \"place in the security stack,\" and \"place under another Digimon or Tamer.\"  It only leaves the battle area by deletion.",
        "question": "What does \"this Digimon can't leave the battle area other than by deletion\" in this card's [Start of Your Main Phase] effect mean, exactly?",
        "reference": "[1]"
      },
      {
        "answer": "No, the card is trashed.  Digimon without DP can't be in the battle area according to the rules, therefore upon the rule check timing, the card is considered a card that doesn't belong in the battle area and is trashed.  This is why that card is trashed even if that Digimon is affected by this card's [Start of Your Main Phase] effect.",
        "question": "If a Digimon that's affected by this card's [Start of Your Main Phase] effect would be trashed because it has no DP, is it still prevented from leaving the battle area?",
        "reference": "[2]"
      }
    ]
  },
